        {q:'How does the RFID/NFC chip work?',a:'The NFC chip inside every SafeTag is pre-programmed with a secure URL. When an NFC-enabled smartphone (most Android and iPhone 7+) is held near the tag, the phone reads the chip and opens a browser tab automatically — no scanning required. Works in darkness, at any angle, and in wet conditions.'},
        {q:'Can I update the information after buying?',a:'Yes. Sign in to your dashboard and update the profile at any time. Changes go live in seconds on both the QR link and the NFC chip URL — no need to replace the physical tag.'},
